{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2014/09/19/3447168/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんかどうしても先輩感が出てしまう。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちょっと意地悪な先輩の役とか出来そうでしょ。出来るよ。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2014/09/19/3447168/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"川後と（＾ν＾）\n部活のマネージャーとかやってみたかったなー。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2014/09/19/3447168/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「明日からは...あなたの専属マネージャーにさせてくださいっ(>_<)」はーと"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"......こんなことしたらまた飛鳥にきもちわるいって言われちゃうからやめとこー(^.^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さてとさてさて明日は名古屋で全国握手会らしい！\nそしてはじめて西野さんとペアらしい！\n意外とはじめてなんだよね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんか七瀬に握手してるとこ見られるの恥ずかしい。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"七瀬ファンの皆さん能條と何話せば良いんだよって方( *｀ω´)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もうモノマネふってください！レパートリー少ないけど！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しく騒ぎましょ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてあみあみ族はいつも通り楽しみましょう（＾ν＾）らぶ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2014/09/19/3447168/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"懐かしい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明後日の名古屋個握もワクワクやー。\nわんちゃんみたいに待ってるね( *｀ω´)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わんわん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そういえば10月18日のわたしのバースデー握手会、4部も5部も両方完売したらしい嬉しいかぎり嬉しいかぎり。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"嬉しいから一生懸命みんなを釣っちゃお。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ずっきゅん だとパクりだから、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":".........んーーーー......"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「デュクシュ！！」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よく小学生の男の子がヒーローごっことかでよくやる効果音。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"デュクシュッ！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"......微妙だねやめとこか。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"んーなんか考えとくよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もしくは皆さんにアンケートとろっかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なにかあみにもオリジナルの必殺技がほしい！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"思いついた方コメント欄へどうぞ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"では！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2014/09/19/3447168/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「乃木派」"}],"source":"archive"}